Original Work
=======================================================================

This repository is based on the source code published alongside:

  "A Multi-view Dataset for Vietnamese Word-Level Sign Language Recognition"

  Authors: Nguyen Quoc, Trung; Pham Dang, Khoi; Truong Duy, Viet;
           Truong Hoang, Vinh; Bilik, Simon; Sindelar, Matej;
           Stefansky, Jakub; Łysiak, Adam; Martinek, Radek; Bilik, Petr

  Institution: VSB – Technical University of Ostrava, Czechia
  DOI:         https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17943574
  Published:   March 9, 2026

The original work is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0).

